
+----+----------------------------------------+--------------------------------------------------------------+
| #  | Issue                                  | Why It Blocks Launch                                         |
+----+----------------------------------------+--------------------------------------------------------------+
| 1  | No Payment System                      | Renters can't pay, sellers can't get paid.                  |
|    |                                        | The business cannot function without payments.              |
+----+----------------------------------------+--------------------------------------------------------------+
| 2  | No Email Verification on Signup        | Fake accounts, spam users, and poor data quality.           |
+----+----------------------------------------+--------------------------------------------------------------+
| 3  | Race Condition on Booking              | Two users can book the same item at the same time.          |
|    |                                        | This creates double bookings and customer disputes.         |
+----+----------------------------------------+--------------------------------------------------------------+
| 4  | S3 Bucket Publicly Readable            | Seller documents (NIC, bank details) could be accessed      |
|    |                                        | by anyone with the file URL.                                |
+----+----------------------------------------+--------------------------------------------------------------+
| 5  | No Rental Agreement / Terms Acceptance | No legal protection in disputes between renter and seller.  |
+----+----------------------------------------+--------------------------------------------------------------+
| 6  | No Dispute / Refund System             | Users have no recourse if an item is damaged or not         |
|    |                                        | returned properly.                                          |
+----+----------------------------------------+--------------------------------------------------------------+
| 7  | No KYC Validation for Sellers          | kycVerified field exists but is never set to true anywhere  |
|    |                                        | in the application logic.                                   |
+----+----------------------------------------+--------------------------------------------------------------+
+----+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| 8  | Missing security headers (HSTS, X-Frame-Options, X-Content-Type-Options).                    |
+----+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| 9  | Seller document uploads have no MIME type validation (unlike item image uploads).           |
+----+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| 10 | In-memory rate limiting will leak memory at scale. Must move rate limiting to Redis.        |
+----+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| 11 | Gmail SMTP has daily sending limits and is not suitable for national scale.                  |
|    | Use AWS SES or SendGrid instead.                                                              |
+----+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| 12 | No error tracking service (Sentry / Datadog). Production issues will be hard to diagnose.    |
+----+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| 13 | No request correlation IDs. Individual user requests cannot be traced in logs.               |
+----+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| 14 | JSON request body has no size limit. Large payloads could crash the server.                  |
+----+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| 15 | Item availability is not automatically updated when a booking is confirmed.                  |
|    | This creates a double-booking risk.                                                           |
+----+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
+----+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| 16 | No seller rating or review system.                                                          |
+----+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| 17 | No location-based or distance-based item search.                                            |
+----+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| 18 | No seller suspension mechanism for fraudulent or abusive users.                            |
+----+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| 19 | No API versioning (recommended format: /api/v1/).                                           |
+----+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| 20 | Timezone issue. Server stores LocalDateTime without timezone information.                  |
|    | Sri Lanka timezone = UTC +05:30.                                                            |
+----+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| 21 | Password reset token validity is only 15 minutes. Too short for potential email delays.    |
+----+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| 22 | Phone numbers are stored but never validated or verified.                                  |
+----+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| 23 | No data retention policy or PDPA compliance (Sri Lanka Personal Data Protection Act).      |
+----+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| 24 | No admin audit table to record which admin approved which seller and from which IP.        |
+----+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| 25 | No HTTP caching headers for item search endpoints.                                          |
|    | This will create unnecessary database load for repeated queries.                           |
+----+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+

